# Active Recon — Complete Notes

## 1. Ping

### Purpose

`ping` ka use ye check karne ke liye hota hai ki target machine network par reachable hai ya nahi.

### Syntax

```bash
ping MACHINE_IP
```

### Example

```bash
ping 10.10.10.10
```

### How it works

`ping` commonly **ICMP Echo Request** bhejta hai aur target se **ICMP Echo Reply** expect karta hai.

```text
Your Machine
     |
     | ICMP Echo Request
     v
 Target Machine
     |
     | ICMP Echo Reply
     v
Your Machine
```

### Important

- `ping` commonly ICMP use karta hai.
- Reply milna generally indicate karta hai ki target reachable hai.
- Reply na milne ka matlab automatically ye nahi hai ki machine down hai.
- Firewall ya network configuration ICMP ko block kar sakti hai.

### Remember

```text
Ping → Is the target reachable?
```

