# 5. Active Recon — Overall Flow

Active reconnaissance involves directly interacting with the target or its services to gather information.

A simplified learning flow:

```text
PING
  |
  v
Is the target reachable?
  |
  v
TRACEROUTE
  |
  v
What route / hops exist?
  |
  v
TELNET
  |
  v
Can I establish a TCP connection?
  |
  v
NETCAT
  |
  +---- Banner grabbing
  |
  +---- TCP communication
  |
  +---- UDP communication
  |
  +---- Listening
```

---

